# a text scenario: Settings, a page long enough to scroll (skipped when the page fits), the mouse wheel moves it (nothing is changed)
name: settings-wheel-scrollbar
devices: real qemu
restore: none (read-only)
doc: opens the Backup page of Settings; when it shows a scrollbar the wheel must move the page, and a page that fits must show none
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Backup
click-sidebar Backup
wait app=Settings page=Backup
shot before
skip-unless-scrollbar
scroll down
shot after
expect-changed
expect-scrollbar
